---
// No real Google Business Profile or verified review count exists -
// never fabricates a star average, review count, or profile link. See
// docs/GREENCAL_OWNER_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED.md.
//
// Master Completion Workflow, Phase 5 (2026-07-29): this is now the
// entire "Customer Reviews" section's content (Testimonials.astro no
// longer renders 3 placeholder ReviewCards alongside it - see that
// file's comment). Redesigned as one intentional, card-styled panel
// (matching the site's shared card visual vocabulary - white
// background, border, shadow, radius-lg - see
// docs/GREENCAL_PUBLIC_WEBSITE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md) so it reads as a
// deliberate "building our review base" statement rather than a
// leftover disclaimer. Wording is unchanged in substance - still
// honest, still no fabricated rating/count/link.
---

<div class="review-summary">
  <div class="review-summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
      <path
        d="M10 1l2.6 5.6 6.1.6-4.6 4.2 1.3 6.1L10 14.8 4.6 17.5l1.3-6.1L1.3 7.2l6.1-.6z"
      />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="review-summary-status">
    Google review integration is not yet connected. Verified reviews and a live rating summary
    will appear here once available.
  </p>
  <div class="review-summary-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>
      View All Reviews
    </button>
    <span class="review-summary-badge">Google Business Profile: not yet connected</span>
  </div>
  <p class="review-summary-note">
    Both will become real, working links once a verified Google Business Profile is connected -
    shown disabled here rather than as dead links.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .review-summary {
    max-width: 36rem;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-cream-100);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .review-summary-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-gold-500);
    background-color: var(--color-cream-100);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .review-summary-icon svg {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
  }

  .review-summary-status {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block: 0 var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-charcoal-900);
  }

  .review-summary-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3);
  }

  .review-summary-actions .btn[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.55;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .review-summary-badge {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-charcoal-600);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .review-summary-note {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-charcoal-600);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-block: 0;
  }
</style>
